WEBVTT

00:01:59.668 --> 00:02:02.067
that the South Bronx had had
in more than 60 years.

00:02:02.091 --> 00:02:05.457
We leveraged that $10,000 seed grant
more than 300 times,

00:02:05.481 --> 00:02:07.721
into a $3 million park.

00:02:07.745 --> 00:02:12.673
And in the fall, I'm going to exchange
marriage vows with my beloved.

00:02:12.697 --> 00:02:13.697
(Audience whistles)

00:02:13.721 --> 00:02:14.989
Thank you very much.

00:02:15.013 --> 00:02:19.555
(Applause)

00:02:19.579 --> 00:02:22.976
That's him pressing my buttons
back there, which he does all the time.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:25.464
(Laughter)

00:02:25.488 --> 00:02:28.805
(Applause)

00:02:28.829 --> 00:02:31.607
But those of us living
in environmental justice communities